OCWORLD 1
NAME ParticleDemo
GROUND 0.0 0
KILLZ -5000.0
SPAWN -600 0 100 0
# Low sun so the additive effects read and the ambient-lit smoke has a colour to pick up.
SUN elev 6.0 azim 200.0 color 1 0.82 0.62 lux 9000
SKY model physical
FOG density 0.00004 color 0.55 0.6 0.7 falloff 0.0006 height 0
# Nothing here is a third-party asset: every mesh is the built-in unit cube (half-extent 1 cm). +X is forward from the spawn.
# Wave 10 particles (docs/PARTICLES.md): six placed emitters in a row along Y, ten metres ahead of the spawn, left to right
# (-Y to +Y): Embers (GPU), FireSmoke (3 emitters, a death event), SparkTrails (trail ribbons), BeamRibbon (linked ribbon),
# Debris (mesh particles, lit by the point light beside it). Rain100k is 100,000 particles over the whole area, 18 m up.
PLACEG Meshes/cube.ocmesh 0 0 -50 0 0 0 4000 4000 50 name Floor
PLACE Meshes/cube.ocmesh 1000 -1200 2 0 0 0 1 nocollide name Embers
  COMPONENT ParticleEmitter effect=Particles/Embers.ocparticle sim=auto playing=true seed=0
PLACE Meshes/cube.ocmesh 1000 -600 2 0 0 0 1 nocollide name FireSmoke
  COMPONENT ParticleEmitter effect=Particles/FireSmoke.ocparticle sim=auto playing=true seed=0
PLACE Meshes/cube.ocmesh 1000 0 2 0 0 0 1 nocollide name SparkTrails
  COMPONENT ParticleEmitter effect=Particles/SparkTrails.ocparticle sim=auto playing=true seed=0
PLACE Meshes/cube.ocmesh 1000 600 120 0 0 0 1 nocollide name BeamRibbon
  COMPONENT ParticleEmitter effect=Particles/BeamRibbon.ocparticle sim=auto playing=true seed=0
PLACE Meshes/cube.ocmesh 1000 1200 2 0 0 0 1 nocollide name Debris
  COMPONENT ParticleEmitter effect=Particles/Debris.ocparticle sim=auto playing=true seed=0
PLACE Meshes/cube.ocmesh 1000 0 1800 0 0 0 1 nocollide name Rain100k
  COMPONENT ParticleEmitter effect=Particles/Rain100k.ocparticle sim=gpu playing=true seed=0
# A warm point light by the debris so the Lit mode has something to react to, and one by the fire.
LIGHT name DebrisLamp kind point pos 900 1200 160 colour 1 0.85 0.6 intensity 6000 range 700
LIGHT name FireGlow kind point pos 900 -600 90 colour 1 0.55 0.2 intensity 9000 range 900
